        },
        {
          "text": "ngo Na we azokwegakwega Sisera, umugabisha w’ingabo za Yabina, agusange ku mugezi Kishoni n’imikogote yiwe n’ingabo ziwe, kandi ngw Azomugabura mu maboko yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraki aramwishura, ati Ni twajana nawe nzogenda, ariko ni tutajana sinzogenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramwishura, ati Nuko tuzojana: yamara rer’ urwo rugendo uzogenda ntiruzotuma ushirwa hejuru, kuk’ Uhoraho agiye kuzogabura Sisera mu maboko y’umugore. Nuko Debora ava hasi, ajana na Baraki i Kedeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.5.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 5:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Baraki ahamagaza Abazebuloni n’Abanafutali ngo bakoranire i Kedeshi; nukw ingabo ibihumbi cumi ziradūga zimukōndōreye inyuma, na Debora na we barajana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
