        },
        {
          "text": "Heberi w’Umunyakeni yari yaritandukanije n’Abanyakeni bandi, ari bo buzukuruza ba Hobabu muramu wa Mose, yar’ ashinze ihema ryiwe musi y’igiti c’umweloni i Sananimu, hafi y’i Kedeshi.",
