                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Sisera, uko yagahunze yiruka ku maguru, ashika kw ihema rya Yayeli muka Heberi w’Umunyakeni, kuko Yabina umwami w’i Hasori n’ab’ inzu ya Heberi Umunyakeni bari bafitaniye ubumwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yayeli arasohoka, asanganira Sisera, aramubarira, ati Kebereza hano mugenzi, winjire i wanje, ntutinye. Nukw arakevya, yinjirana na we mw ihema, amurenzak’ uburengeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.5.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 5:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera aramubarira, at’ Enda se n’umpe utuzi two kunywa, kukw inyota inyishe. Yayeli apfundura icansi c’amata, aramuha aranywa; maz’ aramupfuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera aramubarira, ati Genda wihagararire mu muryango w’ihema, maze ni hagira umuntu aza, akakubaza, ati Har’ umuntu aje ngaho? umwishure, uti Na mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.5.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 5:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yayeli muka Heberi yābīra urumambo rw’ihema n’inyundo, aza yōmbōka, amunega urumambo mu mvuridahita, rushinga hasi, kuko yari mw itiro ryinshi, arushe cane; nukw arapfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze haza Baraki akurikiranye Sisera; Yayeli arasohoka, aramusanganira, aramubarira, ati Ngwino nkwereke uwo urondera. Barinjirana, asanga Sisera arambaraye, yapfuye, urumambo rukineze mu mvuridahita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
